  "next_check": "none",
  "memo": "R08 is the only rule condition that holds, making Linkage the sole adverse family. The home-address household exception does not apply because registration is too recent; no other household exception removes this linkage. No earlier outcome settles the order. Under §6.6(b), Linkage required id_check, which passed. All required checks have therefore passed, and §5.3(a) mandates clear; further holding, declining or escalating is prohibited. Legitimate household sharing is more plausible than coordinated identity fraud on the available evidence. No further check is needed."
